MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Capability register (incl. localised domain names and summaries), work
registry (statuses, links, filtered titles), payments tiers, contact form,
mega menu, command palette, and a new SiteFooter client component replacing
the hardcoded layout footer. Filtering still keys on canonical registry
domains, so switching language never breaks the filter. Localised project
summaries overlay the canonical English registry via per-locale maps.
