are dev-only glob-in-eslint and Next advisories patched only in 15/16 —
low exposure for a fully static prerendered site; Next 15 migration is
tracked as its own workstream). Tailwind was configured but its directives
were never loaded — pure install weight, removed. *.tsbuildinfo ignored.
